# E-Commerce Sales Operations Analysis

## Technologies Used
SQL Server (SSMS), Excel Power Query, Python (pandas), DAX, and Power BI.

## Project Overview
- Cleaned and standardized data from multiple sources using SQL Server, Power Query, and pandas.
- Integrated seven tables into a unified star-schema data model.
- Designed interactive Power BI dashboards to analyze sales performance, customer behavior, product returns, and delivery operations.
- Improved data quality and data integration for consistent reporting.

## Project Structure
- `cleaned/` — Cleaned datasets
- `excel/` — Excel and Power Query files
- `powerbi/` — Power BI documentation and dashboard files
- `python/` — Python data cleaning scripts
- `sql/` — SQL queries and scripts
